--- !u!114 &3298234864207022646
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1511241662969252896}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 386db9909b7e3164c8f6dbf9d2e8bf2a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroManager
  blackImage: {fileID: 2950281403524514494}
  introText: {fileID: 5119523025141879032}
  introTexts:
  - A fine worker of Plutos Industries, one of countless AT0805 units.
  - Not the most fuel-efficient, but I get the job done!
  - ...Of course. I do nothing but work myself to the bone here.
  - I'll tell you this, just between us. The boss here is downright ruthless.
  - He works us robots to the bone, running us until our fuel runs dry!
  - 'Perhaps that''s only natural.

    In this society, we''re treated as nothing
    more than machines.'
  - 'All I can do is sit in this chair...

    inspecting faulty goods. That''s what
    I was made for.'
  - Don't worry. Even I have something to look forward to...
  - 'For the first time, I feel like someone who doesn''t even know

    my face
    or name truly understands me!'
  - If I can keep my fuel running and still feel this kind of happiness, maybe this
    isn't such a bad life after all.
  textDuration: 1.5
  typingSpeed: 0.03
  fadeDuration: 1
  bgm: {fileID: 6174961248708569941}
  bgmFadeDuration: 1
  nextSceneName: D-9
  startOfGame: 1
  chatImg: {fileID: 7515301378082972448}
  endOfGame: 0
